  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1302.13 School bus type",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1302.13 \"School bus type\" means a type A, B, C, or D school bus as defined in the “National School Transportation Specifications & Procedures”, 2015 edition, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #4873, eff 07-24-90; ss by #6297, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8122, INTERIM, eff 7-17-04, EXPIRES: 1-13-05; ss and moved by #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1302.12); amd by #8723, eff 9-8-06; ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (formerly Saf-C 1302.15) (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
